        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In our <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FedCM_API/IDP_integration\" rel=\"nofollow\">Identity provider integration with FedCM</a> page, we mention the <code class=\"notranslate\">approved_clients</code> field of the accounts list endpoint JSON, but we don't say what it does.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR aims to add that detail.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #38259.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2867261553\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38259\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/38259/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38259\">#38259</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
